{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "01RR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "MATH_0003": "$V$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$U \\cap V$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:478d0dc07bd65f0b1533140ca36cd339b46ea717c12e765c1d519d5a95072117", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:26e4ba80c8d2b456254265ca03c110b54788bd455263c241bb3626b424bffc31", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Note that if <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> are dense open\nin <MATH_0004>, then so is <MATH_0005>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0edbd387b0f94789be26b7fe2d9325cfc198aef1f0dbac18fbbea1ca14b4c8a6", "unit_id": "tag:01RR:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "01RR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$Y$", "MATH_0003": "$f : U \\to Y$", "MATH_0004": "$g : V \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$U$", "MATH_0006": "$V$", "MATH_0007": "$X$", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "MATH_0009": "$g$", "MATH_0010": "$f|_W = g|_W$", "MATH_0011": "$W \\subset U \\cap V$", "MATH_0012": "$X$", "MATH_0013": "$X$", "MATH_0014": "$Y$", "MATH_0015": "$X$", "MATH_0016": "$Y$", "MATH_0017": "$S$", "MATH_0018": "$X$", "MATH_0019": "$Y$", "MATH_0020": "$S$", "MATH_0021": "$X$", "MATH_0022": "$Y$", "MATH_0023": "$f : U \\to Y$", "MATH_0024": "$S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0003": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0003": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-rational-map}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c8db08e6c7ba493080a1a14bcddf669d893487481888835a07c81bb8e1381ce7", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e0ecea13dce21152e65c8a2538adfb33d40bd3a188d69fe6297afd5af5db2bab", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> be schemes.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> Let <MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004> be morphisms of schemes defined\non dense open subsets <MATH_0005>, <MATH_0006> of <MATH_0007>. We say that <MATH_0008> is\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>equivalent<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> to <MATH_0009> if <MATH_0010> for some <MATH_0011>\ndense open in <MATH_0012>.\n<STRUCT_0003> A <TEXTITOPEN_0002>rational map from <MATH_0013> to <MATH_0014><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\nis an equivalence class for the equivalence relation defined in (1).\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0015>, <MATH_0016> are schemes over a base scheme <MATH_0017> we say that\na rational map from <MATH_0018> to <MATH_0019> is an <TEXTITOPEN_0003><MATH_0020>-rational map from <MATH_0021>\nto <MATH_0022><TEXTITCLOSE_0003> if there exists a representative <MATH_0023> of the equivalence\nclass which is an <MATH_0024>-morphism.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d388228a38b17e318ce6d11d53f7597c9231eaaa52451fc9871134c9b08b14d5", "unit_id": "tag:01RS:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "01RR", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$g$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:29b2afaec9f4c2ae16bdd9fb00fed63b2efb108faada5dbefaab9bdfaf8ffb39", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:54a56526c4cb1a2661ae78b6d3c5cb06cf86db951868af197108a734af22efb5", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe say that two morphisms <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002> as in (1) of the definition\ndefine the same rational map instead of saying that they are equivalent.\nIn some cases rational maps are determined by maps on local rings\nat generic points.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0fc9b2f505fb310ced1b09a1f08fee6c6f8d3b8b5f08b4ea073c583f1332cb6d", "unit_id": "tag:01RR:prose-0002"}
